WEBVTT

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:03.263
for equitable distribution
amongst various countries.

00:02:03.297 --> 00:02:05.897
So I think all these efforts show you

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:10.330
that there is a collective force
for global public good

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:13.363
that is gaining a lot of acceptance.

00:02:13.397 --> 00:02:17.030
SR: I think nothing to sort of show you
how interconnected we truly are

00:02:17.063 --> 00:02:19.430
than a global pandemic.

00:02:19.463 --> 00:02:23.430
So, you know, it's pretty amazing,

00:02:23.463 --> 00:02:25.697
almost unbelievable that a year into this,

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:28.630
we have multiple vaccines
that are rolling out.

00:02:28.663 --> 00:02:30.130
And as you sort of mentioned,